effects:
One single piercing ranged attack at True Cap Break Level 1, grants Instant ATB 1 & Instant Cast 1 to user;
During Tactical Awoken Mode, Cap Break Level 2 & ATB Speed x1.2 to Fire/Earth/Wind/Poison Abilities, and Weapon Skill Blue/Gold if the user has at least Lv.0/2 En-Fire/Earth/Wind/Poison;
WS Blue: Grants [Lv.2 En-Fire/Earth/Wind/Poison Stack] to user
WS Gold: Grants [During Tactical Awoken Mode, ATD Speed x1.3 & Instant Cast to Fire/Earth/Wind/Poison Abilities] to user

